{%- capture subject -%}{% if refund.void %}Your payment was canceled{% else %}Your refund was issued{% endif %}: {{ refund.amount }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture html -%}
<p>Hello{% if customer.name %} {{ customer.name }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>{{ refund.amount }} of your payment of {{ refund.payment_amount }}{% if refund.payment_date %} on {{ refund.payment_date }}{% endif %} was {% if refund.void %}canceled{% else %}refunded{% endif %}{% if refund.card %} ({{ refund.card }}){% endif %}{% if refund.invoice_number %}, invoice {{ refund.invoice_number }}{% endif %}.</p>
<p>Depending on your bank, it usually reaches your card within a few business days.</p>
<p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">You receive this email because of a payment to {{ merchant.name }}.</p>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture text -%}
Hello{% if customer.name %} {{ customer.name }}{% endif %},

{{ refund.amount }} of your payment of {{ refund.payment_amount }}{% if refund.payment_date %} on {{ refund.payment_date }}{% endif %} was {% if refund.void %}canceled{% else %}refunded{% endif %}{% if refund.card %} ({{ refund.card }}){% endif %}{% if refund.invoice_number %}, invoice {{ refund.invoice_number }}{% endif %}.

Depending on your bank, it usually reaches your card within a few business days.

You receive this email because of a payment to {{ merchant.name }}.
{%- endcapture -%}
